="131" width="160" height="112" rx="13"/><rect x="428" y="131" width="160" height="112" rx="13"/></g><g font-size="12" letter-spacing="1" fill="#a5c1cb"><text x="49" y="162">DISCOVERY</text><text x="247" y="162">QUALIFICATION</text><text x="445" y="162">CONSULTATION</text></g><g font-size="21" font-weight="700" fill="#ffffff"><text x="49" y="207">Buyer intent</text><text x="247" y="207">Fit + consent</text><text x="445" y="207">Next step</text></g><g fill="none" stroke="url(#finLine)" stroke-width="4" stroke-linecap="round"><path d="M192 188H230"/><path d="M390 188H428"/><path d="M43 322C126 292 171 338 242 303S361 310 419 285 508 313 576 272"/></g><g fill="#eccb95"><circle cx="192" cy="188" r="5"/><circle cx="390" cy="188" r="5"/><circle cx="576" cy="272" r="6"/></g><text x="37" y="375" font-size="15" fill="#dbeaf0">SEO • Paid search • Landing pages • CRM</text><text x="37" y="404" font-size="12" fill="#89adb8">Conceptual flow · no financial results or performance claims</text></svg><div class="ed-campus-bottom"><span>DISCOVERY → QUALIFICATION → FOLLOW-UP → CONSULTATION</span><span>LF / FIN—01</span></div></div></div></section>

<div class="ed-marquee" aria-label="Financial services marketing capabilities"><div class="ed-marquee-track" aria-hidden="true">{Array.from({length:6},()=>(<div class="ed-marquee-group"><span>◆ Financial SEO</span><span>✦ Google Ads &amp; PPC</span><span>◇ Qualified Consultations</span><span>✧ Fintech Acquisition</span><span>▣ CRM &amp; Lead Routing</span><span>◈ Compliance-aware Content</span></div>))}</div></div>
<section class="ed-section ed-cream" id="services"><div class="ed-wrap"><div class="ed-heading"><div><p class="ed-eyebrow">THE CONNECTED CLIENT ACQUISITION SYSTEM</p><h2>Not just more leads. More relevant conversations.</h2></div><p>Combine clear positioning, search demand, useful content and a thoughtful path from inquiry to consultation. All messaging remains subject to client review and applicable rules.</p></div><div class="saas-services"><button type="button" class="saas-service" data-service="0" aria-pressed="true"><span class="ed-capability-icon">⌕</span><h3>Financial Services SEO</h3><p>Reach relevant prospects researching services and qualifications.</p><span class="saas-service-more">Explore capability ↗</span></button>
<button type="button" class="saas-service" data-service="1" aria-pressed="false"><span class="ed-capability-icon">↗</span><h3>Google Ads & PPC</h3><p>Connect intent-led searches with accurate, reviewed landing pages.</p><span class="saas-service-more">Explore capability ↗</span></button>
<button type="button" class="saas-service" data-service="2" aria-pressed="false"><span class="ed-capability-icon">◇</span><h3>Conversion Pages</h3><p>Make expertise, services and next steps clear without overpromising.</p><span class="saas-service-more">Explore capability ↗</span></button>
<button type="button" class="saas-service" data-service="3" aria-pressed="false"><span class="ed-capability-icon">▣</span><h3>Fintech Acquisition</h3><p>Align product signups, demos and onboarding with buyer needs.</p><span class="saas-service-more">Explore capability ↗</span></button>
<button type="button" class="saas-service" data-service="4" aria-pressed="false"><span class="ed-capability-icon">⟳</span><h3>CRM & Follow-up</h3><p>Route consented inquiries and manage longer consideration cycles.</p><span class="saas-service-more">Explore capability ↗</span></button>
<button type="button" class="saas-service" data-service="5" aria-pressed="false"><span class="ed-capability-icon">◎</span><h3>Lead Quality Measurement</h3><p>Track fit-qualified inquiries and completed consultations.</p><span class="saas-service-more">Explore capability ↗</span></button></div><div class="saas-service-panel" id="service-detail" aria-live="polite"><span id="service-eyebrow">CAPABILITY 01 / FINANCIAL SEO</span><h3 id="service-title">Get found by the right prospective clients.</h3><p id="service-copy">Build useful pages for services, locations and buyer questions with transparent information and an appropriate contact path.</p><a href={booking} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Discuss this capability ↗</a></div></div></section>

<section class="ed-section ed-light" id="practices"><div class="ed-wrap"><div class="ed-heading"><div><p class="ed-eyebrow">01 / BUSINESS MODEL FIT</p><h2>Different firms. Different client decisions.</h2></div><p>Select a financial business type to explore a relevant acquisition approach. All messaging must fit approved services and qualifications.</p></div><div class="ed-program-grid"><div class="ed-program-options" role="group" aria-label="Financial service business types"><button class="ed-program active" data-program="advisor" aria-pressed="true"><span>01 / INDEPENDENT ADVISORS</span><strong>Financial Advisors & RIAs</strong><small>Qualified introductory conversations</small></button>
<button class="ed-program " data-program="wealth" aria-pressed="false"><span>02 / PRIVATE WEALTH</span><strong>Wealth Management Firms</strong><small>Relationship-focused inquiries</small></button>
<button class="ed-program " data-program="fintech" aria-pressed="false"><span>03 / FINANCIAL TECHNOLOGY</span><strong>Fintech Companies</strong><small>Relevant users, trials and demos</small></button>
<button class="ed-program " data-program="accounting" aria-pressed="false"><span>04 / TAX & ACCOUNTING</span><strong>Accounting & CPA Firms</strong><small>More fit-qualified business inquiries</small></button>
<button class="ed-program " data-program="lending" aria-pressed="false"><span>05 / LENDING SERVICES</span><strong>Lending & Mortgage Providers</strong><small>Appropriate eligible inquiries</small></button>
<button class="ed-program " data-program="insurance" aria-pressed="false"><span>06 / RISK & PROTECTION</span><strong>Insurance Professionals</strong><small>Relevant coverage conversations</small></button></div><div class="ed-program-detail" aria-live="polite"><p class="ed-eyebrow">CLIENT ACQUISITION BLUEPRINT / <span id="ed-program-number">01</span></p><div class="ed-program-symbol" id="ed-program-symbol" aria-hidden="true">▥</div><h3 id="ed-program-title">Financial Advisors &amp; RIAs</h3><p id="ed-program-description">Reach people looking for advice your firm is authorized to provide.</p><div class="ed-detail-line"><span>CHANNEL STRATEGY</span><strong id="ed-program-ads">Location and expertise pages, relevant search and trust-first content</strong></div><div class="ed-detail-line"><span>LEAD FIT</span><strong id="ed-program-fit">Service fit, location and inquiry purpose</strong></div><div class="ed-detail-line"><span>NEXT STEP</span><strong id="ed-program-action">Route consented inquiries to appropriate staff</strong></div><a href={booking} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Discuss your firm’s strategy ↗</a></div></div></div></section>

<section class="ed-section ed-navy" id="intake"><div class="ed-wrap"><div class="ed-heading"><div><p class="ed-eyebrow">02 / PROSPECT-TO-CONSULTATION JOURNEY</p><h2>Not every click is a qualified prospect.</h2></div><p>Explore the six stages of a considered client-acquisition journey. Review, suitability and consent matter along the way.</p></div><div class="ed-journey"><div class="ed-steps" role="group" aria-label="Financial prospect journey"><button class="ed-step active" data-stage="0" aria-pressed="true"><span>01</span><strong>Discover</strong></button><button class="ed-step " data-stage="1" aria-pressed="false"><span>02</span><strong>Evaluate</strong></button><button class="ed-step " data-stage="2" aria-pressed="false"><span>03</span><strong>Inquire</strong></button><button class="ed-step " data-stage="3" aria-pressed="false"><span>04</span><strong>Qualify</strong></button><button class="ed-step " data-stage="4" aria-pressed="false"><span>05</span><strong>Consult</strong></button><button class="ed-step " data-stage="5" aria-pressed="false"><span>06</span><strong>Nurture</strong></button></div><div class="ed-stage-detail" aria-live="polite"><span id="ed-stage-kicker">STAGE 01 / DISCOVER</span><h3 id="ed-stage-title">Reach people researching a relevant financial service.</h3><p id="ed-stage-body">Service-specific SEO and properly targeted search campaigns help qualified prospects find you.</p><div class="ed-stage-metric"><span>WHAT TO REVIEW</span><strong id="ed-stage-metric">Relevant search and qualified site traffic</strong></div></div></div></div></section>

<section class="ed-section ed-cream" id="automation"><div class="ed-wrap"><div class="ed-heading"><div><p class="ed-eyebrow">03 / RESPONSIBLE CRM &amp; FOLLOW-UP</p><h2>A stronger handoff from inquiry to your team.</h2></div><p>Keep marketing intake focused on contact and service fit. Sensitive financial details belong in approved secure processes, not general lead forms.</p></div><div class="ed-automation-grid"><article tabindex="0"><span class="ed-capability-icon">◎</span><h3>Appropriate inquiry</h3><p>Clear service interest, basic contact information and relevant consent.</p></article><article tabindex="0"><span class="ed-capability-icon">◇</span><h3>Reviewed qualification</h3><p>Route inquiries based on firm-defined criteria and services.</p></article><article tabindex="0"><span class="ed-capability-icon">↺</span><h3>Consented follow-up</h3><p>Coordinate human conversations and permission-based reminders.</p></article><article tabindex="0"><span class="ed-capability-icon">▣</span><h3>Meaningful measurement</h3><p>Distinguish clicks from appropriate consultations and customers.</p></article></div><div class="ed-automation-demo"><div class="ed-demo-top"><span>FINANCIAL INQUIRY / CONCEPT DEMO</span><i>ILLUSTRATIVE</i></div><div class="ed-chat"><p class="ed-chat-user">I'd like to learn whether your firm can help with business financial planning.</p><p class="ed-chat-bot">Our team can explain the services offered and arrange an introductory conversation. Please avoid sharing sensitive financial information in this chat.</p></div><p>Illustrative exchange only. No live client data, advisory recommendation or CRM integration is represented.</p></div></div></section>

<section class="ed-section ed-light" id="planner"><div class="ed-wrap ed-planner-grid"><div><p class="ed-eyebrow">04 / QUALIFIED LEAD PLANNER</p><h2>Explore an illustrative path from interest to conversation.</h2><p class="ed-muted">Adjust hypothetical acquisition-stage assumptions. These are not benchmarks, projections of client acquisition, returns, revenue or assets under management.</p><div class="ed-controls"><label for="ed-inquiries">Monthly relevant site visits <output id="ed-inquiries-label">500</output></label><input id="ed-inquiries" type="range" min="50" max="1000" step="25" value="500"/><label for="ed-qualified">Visitors making an inquiry <output id="ed-qualified-label">40%</output></label><input id="ed-qualified" type="range" min="5" max="90" step="5" value="40"/><label for="ed-contacted">Inquiries meeting your fit criteria <output id="ed-contacted-label">35%</output></label><input id="ed-contacted" type="range" min="5" max="90" step="5" value="35"/><label for="ed-applications">Qualified prospects completing consultation <output id="ed-applications-label">25%</output></label><input id="ed-applications" type="range" min="5" max="80" step="5" value="25"/></div></div><div class="ed-planner-result" aria-live="polite"><span>HYPOTHETICAL MONTHLY SCENARIO</span><div><small>Relevant visits</small><strong id="ed-out-inquiries">500</strong></div><div><small>Inquiry forms</small><strong id="ed-out-qualified">200</strong></div><div><small>Fit-qualified prospects</small><strong id="ed-out-reached">70</strong></div><div class="ed-result-highlight"><small>Potential completed consultations</small><strong id="ed-out-applications">18</strong></div><p>Illustrative arithmetic only; no lead, client, investment outcome or revenue guarantees.</p></div></div></section>

<section class="ed-section ed-navy ed-principles"><div class="ed-wrap"><div class="ed-heading"><div><p class="ed-eyebrow">05 / BUILT FOR TRUST</p><h2>Responsible marketing is part of the client journey.</h2></div></div><div class="ed-experience"><div class="ed-experience-number" aria-hidden="true">01 <small>REVIEWED ACQUISITION</small></div><div><h3>Clear information. Considered inquiries. Human accountability.</h3><p>LeadsFlo connects search, paid acquisition, landing pages and appropriate follow-up. Financial firms control service eligibility, claims, compliance approvals, advice, sales and client onboarding.</p><p>We don't promise investments, clients, assets or revenue, provide legal compliance certification, or present illustrative calculator values as real results. Content and integrations are subject to client policies and applicable requirements.</p></div></div></div></section>

<section class="ed-section ed-cream" id="guides"><div class="ed-wrap"><div class="ed-heading"><div><p class="ed-eyebrow">06 / FINANCIAL MARKETING INSIGHTS</p><h2>Practical guides to responsible client acquisition.</h2></div><p>Advisor lead generation, financial SEO, fintech acquisition, accounting marketing and helpful CRM follow-up.</p></div><div class="ed-guides"><a class="ed-guide" href="/insights/financial-services-seo/"><span>01 / FINANCIAL SERVICES GUIDE</span><h3>Financial Services SEO: How to Attract Qualified Clients</h3><p>A practical SEO strategy for financial services, including search intent, useful service pages, trust signals and qualified inquiry measurement.</p><strong>Read the guide ↗</strong></a><a class="ed-guide" href="/insights/financial-advisor-lead-generation/"><span>02 / FINANCIAL SERVICES GUIDE</span><h3>Financial Advisor Lead Generation: Better Prospects and Consultations</h3><p>How financial advisors can connect relevant search demand, consultation forms, qualification and responsible CRM follow-up.</p><strong>Read the guide ↗</strong></a><a class="ed-guide" href="/insights/fintech-marketing-strategy/"><span>03 / FINANCIAL SERVICES GUIDE</span><h3>Fintech Marketing Strategy: SEO, PPC and Customer Acquisition</h3><p>A fintech marketing framework for positioning, search, paid acquisition, onboarding conversion and consent-aware lifecycle measurement.</p><strong>Read the guide ↗</strong></a><a class="ed-guide" href="/insights/accounting-firm-marketing/"><span>04 / FINANCIAL SERVICES GUIDE</span><h3>Accounting Firm Marketing: Generate More Qualified Client Inquiries</h3><p>Marketing for CPA and accounting firms: service positioning, local SEO, business-client inquiries and consultation workflows.</p><strong>Read the guide ↗</strong></a><a class="ed-guide" href="/insights/financial-services-digital-marketing/"><span>05 / FINANCIAL SERVICES GUIDE</span><h3>Financial Services Digital Marketing: Building Trust and Conversions</h3><p>How financial firms can combine paid media, SEO, landing pages and CRM processes with appropriate approvals and trustworthy reporting.</p><strong>Read the guide ↗</strong></a></div></div></section>

<section class="ed-section ed-light" id="faq"><div class="ed-wrap ed-faq-grid"><div><p class="ed-eyebrow">07 / COMMON QUESTIONS</p><h2>What financial-services teams ask us.</h2></div><div class="ed-faqs">{faq.map(item=>(<details><summary>{item.q}</summary><p>{item.a}</p></details>))}</div></div></section>

